# 基本図形編集をプロセスで、デスクトップのウインドウの仮身から開く (design 11.3), for
# tools/ui_run.py. figproc 1 makes every figure open with the process. A copy of 画用紙
# (mkbig fig) and of 基本文章編集 (mkbig doc) are linked into BTRON, the desktop's first
# window (linkbig); the figure is opened by a double press on its link, so the process is
# given that link (T_PRCOPEN): closed, it writes its view back into the link and its place
# into the metadata. Opened again: 新たな実身に保存 (the desktop's panel asks the name, a
# link to the copy goes into BTRON). The text's link is copied to the tray in BTRON and
# pasted into the figure; its 属性変更 asked of the desktop; pressed twice and carried
# within the window, a copy of its object is linked where it is let go; carried out of the
# window into BTRON, it is put there and leaves the figure. The copy's link is looked for on
# the screen: a drawing of part of the window must not leave the next whole drawing cut to it.
# Keys with Ctrl (01): C 06, V 19, E 08; Enter 28.
mkbig fig 30 4
figproc 1
linkbig 180 45
mkbig doc 5
linkbig 190 70
wait 300
logmark
dclick 190 52
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 32 links 0 autoref 1 parent 1
wait 800
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince figure: link view 0,0 100% (0)
expectsince figure: window kept 100,100 800x600 (0)
expectsince figure: closed
wait 500
logmark
dclick 190 52
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 32 links 0 autoref 1 parent 1
wait 800
# 新たな実身に保存
logmark
click 500 400 1
wait 500
move 510 440
wait 300
move 650 440
move 650 461
wait 300
click 650 461
expectsince figure: chosen save.new
wait 800
shot pl_savenew_ask
key 28
expectsince figure: saved as new (0)
wait 800
shot pl_savenew
# the figure's 道具パネル (100,0 to 498,112) stands over BTRON's links, as the desktop's own
# figure editor's does: BTRON is brought forward by its band first, and the panel, a
# subordinate window of the figure's, goes out of sight while BTRON is the window in use
click 50 14
wait 300
click 230 78
wait 300
key 06 01
wait 300
click 600 500
wait 300
logmark
key 19 01
expectsince figure: pasted, 33 shapes 1 picked
wait 500
shot t2_pasted
click 600 500
wait 300
logmark
click 360 196 1
expectsince figure: menu
wait 1500
# the menu comes up with 保存, chosen last, under the pointer: 仮身操作 six rows down
move 380 316
wait 300
move 480 316
move 485 376
wait 300
click 485 376
expectsince figure: chosen vobj.attr
wait 800
shot t2_attr
key 28
expectsince figure: attr 基本文章編集
wait 500
# 実身複製ドラッグ within the window: pressed twice, carried, let go: a copy linked there
click 600 500
wait 300
logmark
click 360 196
hold 360 196
wait 100
move 460 300
wait 100
move 560 396
wait 300
up
wait 800
shot t2_dupask
key 28
expectsince figure: duplicated 基本文章編集 here (0)
expectsince figure: drew in
wait 500
shot t2_dup
# the copy's link drawn where it was let go (396,258 of the figure): its band, not the paper
pixel 612 400 E1F2F9
# the link carried out of the window into BTRON: it leaves the figure
click 600 500
wait 300
logmark
move 360 196
down
move 300 196
wait 500
move 150 200
wait 500
move 90 200
wait 1000
move 50 190
wait 1000
shot t2_carry
up
expectsince figure: carried 基本文章編集 (0)
expectsince figure: deleted, 33 shapes
wait 500
shot t2_carried
